[00:16.345]Goodnight my love
{"晚安吾爱"}
[00:21.819]Pleasant dreams and sleep tight my love
{"愿你好梦安眠　我的爱人"}
[00:30.343]May tomorrow be sunny and bright
{"愿明日阳光灿烂"}
[00:38.679]And bring you closer to me
{"让你更靠近我身边"}
[00:50.537]Before you go
{"在你离去之前"}
[00:59.404]There's just one thing I'd like to know
{"唯有一事想知晓"}
[01:08.273]If your love is still warm for me
{"你的爱是否仍为我炽热"}
[01:17.133]Or has it gone cold
{"或已冷却消散"}
[01:26.889]If you should awake in the still of the night
{"若你在深夜惊醒"}
[01:34.674]Please have no fear for I'll be there
{"请别害怕　我必守候"}
[01:46.842]You know I care
{"你知我心意"}
[01:50.882]Please give your love to me and always
{"请将你的爱永远交予我"}
[02:02.156]Goodnight my love
{"晚安吾爱"}
[02:06.919]Pleasant dreams and sleep tight my love
{"愿你好梦安眠　我的爱人"}
[02:16.081]May tomorrow be sunny and bright
{"愿明日阳光灿烂"}
[02:27.614]And bring you closer
{"让你更靠近"}
[02:35.949]And bring you closer to me
{"让你更靠近我身边"}
